* Morpho Vault V2 adapters
** Interface
*** allocate(data, assets, selector, sender)
*** deallocate(...)
*** realAssets()
*** returns ids + change
** Specification
*** only the vault calls
*** correct, unique ids
*** approval after deallocate
*** no re-entrancy
*** realAssets never reverts
** Vault side
*** transfer, call, check caps
*** change = new - old allocation
*** total = idle + sum realAssets
*** gains capped by maxRate
** Adapters
*** MorphoMarketV1AdapterV2
**** Blue markets, 3 ids
*** MorphoVaultV1Adapter
**** one V1 vault, 1 id
*** MidnightAdapter (WIP)
left side
** Control
*** curator: add, remove, caps (timelocked)
*** allocator: allocate, liquidity adapter
*** sentinel: deallocate, decrease caps
*** anyone: forceDeallocate (max 2 %)
*** registry (append-only)
** Vault V1 through an adapter
*** code: metamorpho, metamorpho-v1.1
*** why: reuse, migrate, V2 tools
*** realAssets = previewRedeem
*** caveats
**** V1.1 hides losses (lostAssets)
**** one opaque id
**** inflation, re-entrant IRM
**** reverting market blocks V2
@endmindmap
